      *################################################################.00870000
       C000-Interface                    Section.                       00880000
      *                                                                 00890000
      *  Initialize copyareas, and check input                          00900001
      *   - We always have to read Main Contract to get hold of         00910022
      *     the timestamp                                               00920022
      *                                                                 00930001
           Perform C100-Initialize-Output                               00940000
           Move 'ACTUAL'           To Ws-Table-Version                  00950039
           Perform C200-Read-Main-Contract                              00960022
      *                                                                 00970036
           If R115IMC0-In-Progress-Yes                                  00980036
              Move 'WORK'          To Ws-Table-Version                  00990036
              Perform C200-Read-Main-Contract                           01000039
           Else                                                         01010036
              Move 'ACTUAL'        To Ws-Table-Version                  01020036
           End-If                                                       01030036
      *                                                                 01040001
      *                                                                 01050039
           If R115L050-PA-Seq-No         =     +0                       01060004
              Move R115IMC0-Status      To  Ws-Status                   01070004
      *                                                                 01080006
           Else                                                         01090004
              Perform C250-Read-Contract-Amount                         01100032
              Perform C300-Read-Part-Amount                             01110004
              Move R115IPA0-Status      To  Ws-Status                   01120004
      *                                                                 01130006
           End-If                                                       01140004
      *                                                                 01150001
      *  Check that this contract has not been changed since            01160008
      *  this user read the contract information                        01170001
      *                                                                 01180001
      *  Slettet inntil videre for å få gjennom tester i juli. (Nina)   01190041
      *    If   R115L050-Check-For-Upd-Yes                              01200041
      *     and R115L050-Function(3:1) Not = 'R'                        01210041
      *        Perform E000-Check-Upd-Timestamp                         01220041
      *    End-If                                                       01230041
      *                                                                 01240001
      *  Reading to check if this is a valid operation type             01250001
      *                                                                 01260001
           Perform F100-Read-Sys-Code-Rel                               01270030
      *                                                                 01280001
      *  Reading the current STATUS, to return the status properties    01290001
      *                                                                 01300001
           Perform F200-Read-SYS-Code                                   01310001
           Move    R115ISC0-Property    To    R115L050-Cur-Status-Prop  01320001
      *                                                                 01330001
      *  Checking to see if any parameteres will require additional     01340001
      *  tests                                                          01350001
      *                                                                 01360001
           If  R115L050-Function(3:1)     = 'R'                         01370043
           and R115L050-Operation-Type    = 'SHOW'                      01380043
              Continue                                                  01390043
           Else                                                         01400043
              Perform G000-Check-Properties                             01410043
           End-If                                                       01420043
      *                                                                 01430000
           .                                                            01440000
