      *################################################################.04060028
       G000-Check-Properties             Section.                       04070028
      *                                                                 04080028
      * Checking to se if the string PERMANENT is in PROPERTIES         04090001
      * If this is the case we have a permanent STATUS                  04100001
      *                                                                 04110001
           Move +0                       To    Ws-Code-Count            04120001
           Inspect  R115ISC0-Property                                   04130001
                    Tallying    Ws-Code-Count                           04140001
                    For  All   'PERM'                                   04150028
      *                                                                 04160001
      * If this STATUS is a permanent one, and IN-Progress = Y          04170001
      * we will not be allowed to contine                               04180001
      *                                                                 04190001
           If   Ws-Code-Count  >  +0                                    04200001
            and R115IMC0-In-Progress-Yes                                04210001
            and R115L050-Function     Not = 'TFD05'                     04220044
      *                                                                 04230001
               Initialize                   R7918030-ErrorMessage       04240001
               Move  'TF-SY-MC-INPROG-Y'                                04250001
                                         To R7918030-In-MessageCode     04260001
      *                                                                 04270001
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               04280001
               Move  'G001'              To R7919999-Paragraph          04290001
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    04300001
      *                                                                 04310001
           End-If                                                       04320001
      *                                                                 04330001
           .                                                            04340001
